{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Can you bind the re'em with a cord?</b> — like תלמיה רוה (its furrow), and the sense of התקשר רים בתלם is by a rope."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "The phrase תלמיה רוה (Job 31:38) is cited as a parallel for the construct form תלם; I have left it in Hebrew as Ibn Ezra quotes it."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:11.272605737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}